msgctxt "136"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu-san! Did you wanna talk to Kazuki-san about something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Actually, I just dropped in to say hello."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Gotcha. Hope you don't mind, but I've got some important business to deal "
"with right now. Think we could chat some other time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "No problem. Sorry to interrupt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Tell it to me straight, Eiji. Just what is it you're getting at?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "I'm saying you have to open up a second club to keep the Stardust image hot!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "It's now or never, Yuya-san! Kazuki-san could stay here in Kamurocho..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"And you could be the owner of the second club in Yokohama! It'd be great "
"for everybody!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "But I'm the manager here. What would happen to this club without me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "I'm sure Kazuki-san can handle it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"I'm telling you, man. You gotta break away from Kazuki-san and be your own "
"man. Don't you think it's time by now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"That's enough, Eiji. You might not know, since you haven't been here long, "
"but what Kazuki-san says is what goes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"And he says we're not opening a second club, so that's the end of this "
"discussion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"We can continue this discussion some other time. You need to get back to "
"work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Hmph..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Sorry about that. Kyogoku's got everybody all worked up about opening a "
"second club..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"That's understandable. Expanding the business like that would be a big "
"change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"You got that right. But we've got enough to worry about just trying to keep "
"this place on top..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"Anyway, please make yourself at home, Kiryu-san. I still have some work to "
"take care of, so... Sorry about that."
msgstr ""

